{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cDerail\u201d</strong> is a story-driven puzzle game similar to\u00a0<i>Rusty Lake </i>and<i>\u00a0Fran Bow</i>, with a bit of horror.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579650/extras/e90f56370dc38b1f394dadbcc6fe98d9.poster.avif?t=1753375759\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579650/extras/e90f56370dc38b1f394dadbcc6fe98d9.webm?t=1753375759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579650/extras/e90f56370dc38b1f394dadbcc6fe98d9.mp4?t=1753375759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579650/extras/ec6ff21b18dabed976c6182a1f3a59be.webp?t=1753375759\" data-has-big width=800 height=23 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The once peaceful town was thrown into chaos when a coffin falls from the sky. The villagers vanished all of sudden. Only things left are embryos scattered on the empty streets. When you opened the coffin, a living person walked out. &quot;It&quot; claims to be from the 21st century, sent back with future tech to save this country.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579650/extras/2231b508de043438f172415d6009684e.poster.avif?t=1753375759\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579650/extras/2231b508de043438f172415d6009684e.webm?t=1753375759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579650/extras/e237f69db4fef4bd49077e687be6357a.poster.avif?t=1753375759\" width=1600 height=678 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579650/extras/e237f69db4fef4bd49077e687be6357a.webm?t=1753375759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579650/extras/e237f69db4fef4bd49077e687be6357a.mp4?t=1753375759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll play as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A demon-possessed orphan,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A noblewoman who adopts the orphan,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or the nation's general, navigating political intrigue</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moving among the powerful, you'll slowly uncover the dark secrets behind this brutal country.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579650/extras/ec6ff21b18dabed976c6182a1f3a59be.webp?t=1753375759\" data-has-big width=800 height=23 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As for gameplay, besides <strong>exploration and puzzle-solving</strong>, I\u2019ve incorporated <strong>somg TRPG dice mechanics</strong>. You can freely <strong>save-load</strong>, pick some <strong>hellish choices</strong>\u00a0to extort NPCs, and fully embrace the role of a <strong>chaotic player</strong> in this dice-rolling adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579650/extras/21cec42f5f419481843d7ec716b4dbf6.avif?t=1753375759\" data-has-big width=800 height=232 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3579650?t=1753375759","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3579650?t=1753375759","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579650/8ce2d9a43b6fe598b0fd5c00ad6e57083082a309/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753375759","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579650/8ce2d9a43b6fe598b0fd5c00ad6e57083082a309/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753375759","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cDerail\u201d</strong> is a story-driven puzzle game similar to\u00a0<i>Rusty Lake </i>and<i>\u00a0Fran Bow</i>, with a bit of horror.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579650/extras/e90f56370dc38b1f394dadbcc6fe98d9.poster.avif?t=1753375759\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579650/extras/e90f56370dc38b1f394dadbcc6fe98d9.webm?t=1753375759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579650/extras/e90f56370dc38b1f394dadbcc6fe98d9.mp4?t=1753375759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579650/extras/ec6ff21b18dabed976c6182a1f3a59be.webp?t=1753375759\" data-has-big width=800 height=23 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The once peaceful town was thrown into chaos when a coffin falls from the sky. The villagers vanished all of sudden. Only things left are embryos scattered on the empty streets. When 